  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Water Resources Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will promote integrated water resource management in Rwanda.  The project development objectives are: (i) to promote economic growth through sustainable water management and better allocation of water resources amongst users; (ii) to alleviate poverty and its consequences allowing the poorest to have access to water and curbing dependence on rain-fed agriculture; (iii) to strengthen environmental and water resources management capacity within the government and the national institutions to ensure sustainability of the water resources; and (iv) to develop economy and improve quality of life through provision of ample power supply at reasonable prices.</narrative>
  </description>
